# Standing instructions

Freeform. Always loaded. Treated as user instruction, so it outranks the
agents' own defaults.

Keep it short — this file is loaded on every task.

<!-- Examples — replace with your own -->

- Never touch production without me saying "production" explicitly.
- Open PRs against `develop` in the chart repos, `main` everywhere else.
- Paste plan output in full; do not summarise it.
- Prefer several small single-purpose PRs over one large one.
- Always give me the PR URL inline, not just at the end.
